[{"answer":"I'm very pleased to welcome this evening's guest speaker, Mark Logan,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/1.mp3"},{"answer":"who's going to tell us about the recent transformation of Minster Park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Over to you, Mark.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you're all familiar with Minster Park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It's been a feature of the city for well over a century,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and has been the responsibility of the city council for most of that time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What perhaps isn't so well known is the origin of the park:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/8.mp3"},{"answer":"unlike many public parks that started in private ownership,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/9.mp3"},{"answer":"as the garden of a large house, for instance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Minster was some waste land,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/11.mp3"},{"answer":"which people living nearby started planting with flowers in 1892.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It was unclear who actually owned the land,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and this wasn't settled until 20 years later,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/14.mp3"},{"answer":"when the council took possession of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/15.mp3"},{"answer":"You may have noticed the statue near one of the entrances.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's of Diane Gosforth,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/17.mp3"},{"answer":"who played a key role in the history of the park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Once the council had become the legal owner,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/19.mp3"},{"answer":"it planned to sell the land for housing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Many local people wanted it to remain a place that everyone could go to,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/21.mp3"},{"answer":"to enjoy the fresh air and natural environment -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/22.mp3"},{"answer":"remember, the park is in a densely populated residential area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Diane Gosforth was one of those people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and she organised petitions and demonstrations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/25.mp3"},{"answer":"which eventually made the council change its mind about the future of the land.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon after this the First World War broke out, in 1914,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and most of the park was dug up and planted with vegetables,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/28.mp3"},{"answer":"which were sold locally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/29.mp3"},{"answer":"At one stage, the army considered taking it over for troop exercises","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and got as far as contacting the city council,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/31.mp3"},{"answer":"then decided the park was too small to be of use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/32.mp3"},{"answer":"There were occasional public meetings during the war,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/33.mp3"},{"answer":"in an area that had been retained as grass.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/34.mp3"},{"answer":"After the war, the park was turned back more or less to how it had been before 1914,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and continued almost unchanged until recently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Plans for transforming it were drawn up at various times,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/37.mp3"},{"answer":"most recently in 2013,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/38.mp3"},{"answer":"though they were revised in 2015,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/39.mp3"},{"answer":"before any work had started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/40.mp3"},{"answer":"The changes finally got going in 2016,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and were finished on schedule last year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/42.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, let me tell you about some of the changes that have been made","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and some things that have been retained.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/44.mp3"},{"answer":"If you look at this map,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/45.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll see the familiar outline of the park,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/46.mp3"},{"answer":"with the river forming the northern boundary,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and a gate in each of the other three walls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The statue of Diane Gosforth has been moved:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/49.mp3"},{"answer":"it used to be close to the south gate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's now immediately to the north of the lily pond,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/51.mp3"},{"answer":"almost in the centre of the park, which makes it much more visible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/52.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a new area of wooden sculptures, which are on the river bank,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/53.mp3"},{"answer":"where the path from the east gate makes a sharp bend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/54.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two areas that are particularly intended for children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The playground has been enlarged and improved,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's between the river and the path that leads from the pond to the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's a new maze, a circular series of paths, separated by low hedges.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's near the west gate -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/59.mp3"},{"answer":"you go north from there towards the river and then turn left to reach it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/60.mp3"},{"answer":"There have been tennis courts in the park for many years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and they've been doubled, from four to eight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/62.mp3"},{"answer":"They're still in the south-west corner of the park,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/63.mp3"},{"answer":"where there's a right-angle bend in the path.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Something else I'd like to mention is the new fitness area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/65.mp3"},{"answer":"This is right next to the lily pond on the same side as the west gate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, as you're all gardeners,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'll like to hear about the plants that have been chosen for the park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-2-2023-01-14-19-46-58/68.mp3"}]
